nd{bmatrix}\n$$\nThe column $R$ is column $3$ of $I_3$. Right multiplication selects entry $3$ of that row:\n$$\n(LM)R=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\sqrt{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nThe single entry is the dot product\n$$\n(4)\\cdot 0+(7)\\cdot 0+(-2\\sqrt{2})\\cdot 1=-2\\sqrt{2}\n$$"}]}
